[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6420.79, "timestamp": "01:47:00", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6433.59, "timestamp": "01:47:13", "text": "哦，我现在升到二级了。我们走吧。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6440.47, "timestamp": "01:47:20", "text": "精彩的表演"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6446.709, "timestamp": "01:47:26", "text": "好的。那么，在我们继续之前，让我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6458.55, "timestamp": "01:47:38", "text": "所以，嗯，我会把它保留下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6462.39, "timestamp": "01:47:42", "text": "Dash，还要放音乐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6464.31, "timestamp": "01:47:44", "text": "因为我忘了播放音乐，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6467.43, "timestamp": "01:47:47", "text": "是的。是的。是的。所以，我还会回来的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6470.229, "timestamp": "01:47:50", "text": "少量。拿了午餐就回来，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6473.91, "timestamp": "01:47:53", "text": "或许可以先吃点东西，然后再回来速通。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6476.97, "timestamp": "01:47:56", "text": "开始播放音乐吧。是的。"}]